media: qcom: camss: Add SM8450 3-phase C-PHY support

Extend the Qualcomm CAMSS driver to accept V4L2_MBUS_CSI2_CPHY endpoints,
propagate is_cphy through CSID link setup (setting CSI2_RX_CFG0_PHY_TYPE_SEL
on CSID 680), clamp phytimer clocks when C-PHY link_freq/4 exceeds 400 MHz,
and program SM8450 CSIPHY v2.1.0 3-phase init and 1.5-3.3 GSpS data-rate delta
sequences (needed for Galaxy S22 S5KGN3 and IMX563 C-PHY rear cameras).

Signed-off-by: Felipe00100 <felipe00100@users.noreply.github.com>

